<h2>Welcome, <%= current_user.name %>!</h2>
<p>You've signed up successfully, and created a new family (which you are the first member of) called <%= @administered_family.name %>. Now you just have to invite your family members to join the family so you can start sharing your wishlists!</p>
<p>Send this case-insensitive code to your family members, and tell them to enter it when signing up:</p>
<p class='family-code'><%= @administered_family.code %></p>
<p>Only share this code with people you trust, since anyone with the code can join your family and see everyone else's lists.</p>
